# ── Secrets. Never committed. ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
*.env
!.env.example

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Data. Rebuildable from the scripts, and far too large for git. ───────────
# The training panel alone is 93 MB and every byte of it can be regenerated by
# `python scripts/build_dataset.py`. Committing it would make the repository
# unusable for the sake of something reproducible in an hour.
data/cache/
data/*.parquet
data/*.log
!data/.gitkeep

# ── Trained boosters. Large binaries; retrainable in minutes. ────────────────
# Boosters, at any depth. The single-star form missed models/dss_holdout/, which is
# how 3.9 MB of them nearly reached a repository that excludes boosters on purpose.
models/**/*_*h.json
models/**/*_*h.meta.json
models/**/*_*h_q*.json
!models/.gitkeep

# ── RESULTS ARE COMMITTED ON PURPOSE ────────────────────────────────────────
# models/metrics*.json, validation.json, loso.json, plume_calibration*.json,
# ozone_sensitivity.json, uncertainty.json and case_study.json are the evidence
# behind every claim in the README. They are small, they are the point, and a
# reader must be able to check a number without re-running a two-hour pipeline.

# ── Node / editor noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Internal prep documents, kept local ─────────────────────────────────────
# The jury briefing and the team primer are how WE get ready: a script to present
# from and a primer to learn from. They are not part of the product and they carry
# our own framing about what to say and what not to say in a room, which has no
# business in a public repository.
#
# docs/VayuChakra-Report.pdf is NOT here on purpose. That one is a deliverable: the
# dashboard links it, StaticFiles serves it out of the image, and it must ship.
docs/report/briefing.html
docs/report/primer.html
docs/VayuChakra-Jury-Briefing.pdf
docs/VayuChakra-Team-Primer.pdf
